            "value": "<p>AKC Grand Champion Eynhallow Ladybird for Hound Ridge's Scottish deerhound litter is now nine weeks old.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Here are just a few of the lovely and consistent, large litter whelped October 24 from Fritzen\u2019s Doc of the Bay for Hound Ridge X GCH Eynhallow Ladybird for Hound Ridge. We are forever grateful to Bj\u00f6rn, Klaus and Debbie for our wonderful sire and dam. The puppies will be going to their forever homes in early 2026. If you are interested in loving a Scottish deerhound puppy, please <a href=\"mailto:Joyce@HoundRidge.net?subject=I&amp;apos;m interested in puppies\">contact Joyce Weaver<\/a> about puppy availability.<\/p><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"80a95faa-3993-4e8c-8df7-e5bd7aed5970\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_wide\" data-align=\"center\" data-caption=\"Magenta girl\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"b670be7a-a918-484f-85be-b7c4755dabae\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_wide\" data-align=\"center\" data-caption=\"Orange girl\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"f03bc6cd-1b02-454c-bd9b-f46e0c9d62e5\" data-align=\"center\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_wide\" data-caption=\"Pink girl\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"2c207370-431a-4e2b-9c9b-dd5c2313bb70\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_wide\" data-align=\"center\" data-caption=\"Yellow girl\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"2da5d077-3536-467d-8b10-aea274ac493d\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_wide\" data-align=\"center\" data-caption=\"Green boy\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"45b860a8-1bdf-4879-baba-a5a2465b73df\" data-view-mode=\"16_9_wide\" data-align=\"center\" data-caption=\"Red boy\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media>",
